cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Blicsa"
abstract: >-
  Desktop application for bibliometric analysis: literature search across OpenAlex, Crossref
  and PubMed, corpus building, co-occurrence knowledge maps (network, overlay and density),
  and bibliometric statistics. Local-first: the corpus never leaves the user's machine.
authors:
